                     "CLAUDE.md (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md for global facts), supersede the note "
                     "with a pointer, or keep it in memory with `%s touch <id> --keep`."
                     % ("; ".join('#%d \"%s\"' % (r[0]["id"], r[0]["text"][:60])
                                  for r in export), ME))
